          "expandedAnswer": "Yes. I design and build polished Framer websites with responsive layouts, CMS setup, and clean interactions.",
          "fullTextAfterClick": "02Do you build in Framer?Yes. I design and build polished Framer websites with responsive layouts, CMS setup, and clean interactions."
